onible en Tenor.","Are you sure you want to proceed?":"¿Confirmas que quieres continuar?","Are you sure?":"¿Confirmas la acción?","Armenian":"Armenio","Aspect Ratio":"Relación de aspecto","Avatar must be a PNG or JPEG":"El avatar debe ser un archivo PNG o JPEG","Azerbaijani":"Azerí","Bangla":"Bengalí","Banner":"Banner","Basque":"Vasco","Before we can modify your favorites, you must grant Tenor the proper permissions on your Google Account.":"Para que podamos modificar tus favoritos, debes otorgarle a Tenor los permisos correspondientes en tu Cuenta de Google.","Before you can upload, you must grant Tenor the proper permissions on your Google Account.":"Antes de poder subir contenido, debes otorgarle a Tenor los permisos correspondientes en tu Cuenta de Google.","Belarussian":"Bielorruso","Bio":"Biografía","Bosnian":"Bosnio","Browse Files":"Explorar archivos","Browse Files to Upload":"Explora los archivos para elegir cuáles subir","Build your Library":"Crea tu biblioteca","Bulgarian":"Búlgaro","Burmese":"Birmano","Button text":"Texto del botón","By clicking Sign in with Google, you agree to our {tos} and {privacyPolicy}":"Si haces clic en Acceder con Google, aceptas nuestras {tos} y la {privacyPolicy}","By clicking Sign in with Google, you agree to our {tos}, {privacyPolicy}, and {apiTos}":"Cuando haces clic en Acceder con Google, aceptas nuestras {tos}, la {privacyPolicy} y las {apiTos}","CANCEL":"CANCELAR","CAPTION":"LEYENDA","CONFIRM":"CONFIRMAR","CREATE GIF":"CREAR GIF","CREATING GIF":"CREANDO GIF","Cancel":"Cancelar","Cancel editing your GIF?":"¿Quieres cancelar la edición de tu GIF?","Cancel upload?":"¿Quieres cancelar la carga?","Caption":"Leyenda","Catalan":"Catalán","Changes you made will not be saved.":"No se guardarán los cambios que implementaste.","Changes you've made will not be saved.":"No se guardarán los cambios que realizaste.","Check out {username}'s GIFs on Tenor. Discover, search and share popular GIFs with friends on Tenor.":"Descubre los GIF de