igos y familiares.","Create your own GIFs":"Crea tus propios GIF","Created":"Creado","Creating GIFs is fun and easy! Edit the GIFs and MP4s that you upload to Tenor by trimming, cropping, and adding custom captions to your content":"Crear GIF es fácil y divertido. Edita los GIF y MP4 que subes a Tenor: puedes cortar y recortar tu contenido y agregarle leyendas personalizadas","Creation Tools":"Herramientas de creación","Croatian":"Croata","Crop":"Recortar","Czech":"Checo","DONE":"LISTO","DOWNLOAD YOUR GIFS":"DESCARGA TUS GIF","Danish":"Danés","Delete":"Borrar","Delete Account":"Borrar cuenta","Delete?":"¿Borrar?","Deleting your account will permanently remove all of your uploads, favorites, and packs. If you previously linked a Google account to your profile, you will be able to use your Google profile to create a new account in 24 hours.":"Si borras tu cuenta, se quitarán de forma permanente todas tus cargas, elementos favoritos y paquetes. En caso de que ya hayas vinculado una Cuenta de Google a tu perfil, podrás usar tu perfil de Google para crear una cuenta nueva en 24 horas.","Details":"Detalles","Developer Dashboard":"Panel del desarrollador","Dimensions":"Dimensiones","Display Name":"Nombre visible","Divehi":"Divehi","Download":"Descargar","Download Pack":"Descargar paquete","Download from iTunes":"Descargar desde iTunes","Download {packName} Pack":"Descargar el paquete {packName}","Download {username}’s {packName} Pack":"Descarga el paquete {packName} de {username}","Drag & Drop to Upload Here":"Arrastra el contenido y suéltalo aquí para subirlo","Drag and drop files (or click here)":"Arrastra y suelta los archivos (o haz clic aquí)","Drag jpg or png here or click to upload":"Arrastra un archivo JPG o PNG aquí o haz clic para subirlo","Drop to upload!":"Suelta el contenido para subirlo.","Duration":"Duración","Dutch":"Neerlandés","Earlier":"Anteriores","Edit Profile":"Editar perfil","Edit and Tag your content":"Edita y etiqueta tu contenido","Embed":"Incorporar","English":"Español","English (Austrailia)":"Inglés (Australia)","English (Canada)":"Inglés (Canadá)","English (Great Britain)":"Inglés (Gran Bretaña)","English (India)":"Inglés (India)","English (Ireland)":"Inglés (Irlanda)","English (New Zealand)":"inglés (Nueva Zelanda)","English (Pseudo Accents)":"Inglés (seudoacentos)","English (Pseudo Cracked)":"Inglés (seudocifrado)","English (Singapore)":"Inglés (Singapur)","English (South Africa)":"Inglés (Sudáfrica)","Error Icon":"Ícono de error","Estonian":"Estonio","Explore":"Explorar","Explore GIFs":"Explorar GIF","Explore GIFs - Tenor GIF Keyboard":"Explora GIF: Tenor GIF Keyboard","FAQ":"Preguntas frecuentes","FEATURED TAGS":"ETIQUETAS DESTACADAS","Fakebidi":"Falsobidi","Favorites":"Favoritos","Featured GIFs":"GIF destacados","File Size":"Tamaño de archivo","File upload error icon":"Ícono de error en la carga del archivo","File upload success":"Se subió correctamente el archivo","File upload success icon":"Ícono de carga correcta del archivo","Filipino":"Filipino","Finnish":"Finés","French":"Francés","French (Canadian)":"Francés (canadiense)","French (Switzerland)":"Francés (Suiza)","GIF Keyboard":"GIF Keyboard","GIF Keyboard for iMessage by Tenor | Tenor GIF Keyboard":"GIF Keyboard para iMessage de Tenor | Tenor GIF Keyboard","GIF Keyboard logo":"Logotipo de GIF Keyboard","GIF Maker | Tenor":"GIF Maker | Tenor","GIFs":"GIFs","Galician":"Gallego","Georgian":"Georgiano","German":"Alemán","German (Austria)":"Alemán (Austria)","German (Switzerland)":"Alemán (Suiza)","Get Started":"Comenzar","Get notified on how your GIFs are performing and how often they've been searched and shared.":"Recibe notificaciones sobre el rendimiento de tus GIF y la frecuencia con que se buscaron y compartieron.","Getting Started":"Cómo comenzar","Getting started on Tenor":"Comienza a usar Tenor","Gif successfuly removed.":"Se quitó el GIF correctamente.","Google Privacy Policy":"Política de Privacidad de Google","Google Terms of Service":"Condiciones del Servicio de Google","Grant Tenor Permissions":"Otorgar permisos a Tenor","Greek":"Griego","Gujarati":"Gujarati","HD GIF":"GIF en HD","Hebrew":"Hebreo","Height":"Altura","Hindi":"Hindi","How your name appears on Tenor":"Cómo se muestra tu nombre en Tenor","Hungarian":"Húngaro","I agree to Tenor's {tos} and {privacyPolicy}":"Acepto las {tos} y la {privacyPolicy} de Tenor","I agree to Tenor's {tos}, {privacyPolicy}, and {apiTos}":"Acepto las {tos}, la {privacyPolicy} y las {apiTos} de Tenor","Icelandic":"Islandés","If it helps you express, this is the place for it. And if it needs some fine tuning, you can trim, crop, and caption before sharing.":"Si te ayuda a expresarte, este es el lugar indicado. Además, si necesitas hacer ajustes en el contenido, puedes recortarlo y agregar leyendas antes de compartirlo.","Indonesian":"Indonesio","Introducing...":"Presentamos…","Italian":"Italiano","JS will not work in this environment, use the static HTML.":"JS no funcionará en este entorno; usa el código HTML estático.","Japanese":"Japonés","Kannada":"Canarés","Kazakh":"Kazajo","Khmer":"Jemer","Korean":"Coreano","Kurdish":"Kurdo","Kyrgyz":"Kirguís","Language":"Idioma","Lao":"Laosiano","Latvian":"Letón","Legacy Account Recovery":"Recuperación de cuentas heredadas","Link":"Vínculo","Lithuanian":"Lituano","Log out":"Salir","MP4":"MP4","Macedonian":"Macedonio","Make it yours to share with your friends":"Personalízalos para compartirlos con tus amigos","Make your own GIFs with your front or back facing camera — just tap the camera button to activate! Personalize your captured GIFs with text, a handwritten note or drawings.":"Crea tus propios GIF con la cámara frontal o posterior: presiona el botón de la cámara para activar la función. Personaliza los GIF capturados con texto, notas escritas a mano o dibujos.","Malay":"Malayo","Malayalam":"Malabar","Marathi":"Maratí","Max file size is {maxUploadSizeMB}MB":"El tamaño máximo del archivo es de {maxUploadSizeMB} MB","Memes"